"index_reference": "31001007",
"language": "eng",
"review_level": "Professional",
"content": "<ul><li><p><em>men allied with you </em>(literally <em>men of the covenant</em>): Edom should have been Israel&apos;s ally, but instead, Edom made a covenant with Babylon. </p></li><li><p><em>men of peace</em> (paralleling <em>men of the covenant</em>): This was a fitting form of justice. Edom betrayed Israel, and later, Babylon betrayed Edom in the same way.</p></li></ul>",
