"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "Obadiah 1:12",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "31001012",
"language": "eng",
"review_level": "Professional",
"content": "<ul><li><p>The tribes of Israel were relatives of Edom (literally <em>brother;</em> compare <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04020014\" data-end-ref=\"04020014\">Numbers 20:14</data>). </p></li><li><p>Edom and other nearby nations mistakenly believed that making peace with Nebuchadnezzar in 586&nbsp;BC would give them relief. However, their time of judgment would come.</p></li></ul>",
