"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "Obadiah 1:15",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "31001015",
"language": "eng",
"review_level": "Professional",
"content": "<ul><li><p><em>The Day of the LORD is near</em>: The phrase <em>the day of the Lord</em> sometimes referred to a specific event, like the destruction of Edom or Joel’s locust plague (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"29001015\" data-end-ref=\"29001015\">Joel 1:15</data>). In its final form, it represents God&apos;s final judgment on all godless nations. </p></li><li><p><em>As you have done</em>: Those who face judgment will find their punishment reflects their evil actions.</p></li></ul>",
"associations": {
